# Old Webflow URLs -> the new site. Crawled from the live eleveno.com on
# 2026-08-25; that site is a closed set of 8 pages with nothing deeper.
# 301 = permanent, which is what passes the old page's search ranking on.
# Netlify matches these top-down, so order matters.

/about              /                       301
/partners           /                       301
/pickleball         /#play                  301
/eat-and-drink      /menu-food.html         301
/private-events     /private-events.html    301

# /privacy-policy and /terms-and-conditions need no rule. Both pages were
# ported, and Netlify serves privacy-policy.html for the extensionless path,
# so the old Webflow URLs keep resolving on their own.
